WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.456 --> 00:00:03.713
Unit nineteen. Renewable Energy!

2
00:00:04.845 --> 00:00:11.076
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level four!

3
00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:14.417
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:18.134
Today we learn: Renewable Energy. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:23.958
Renewable energy. Say it with me. Renewable energy!

6
00:00:27.472 --> 00:00:31.538
Solar power. Say it with me. Solar power!

7
00:00:35.027 --> 00:00:39.244
Wind turbine. Say it with me. Wind turbine!

8
00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:46.784
Fossil fuel. Say it with me. Fossil fuel!

9
00:00:50.312 --> 00:00:54.245
Sustainable. Say it with me. Sustainable!

10
00:00:57.744 --> 00:01:01.310
Emission. Say it with me. Emission!

11
00:01:04.787 --> 00:01:09.387
Clean energy. Say it with me. Clean energy!

12
00:01:12.916 --> 00:01:16.650
Resource. Say it with me. Resource!

13
00:01:20.201 --> 00:01:29.098
Grammar time! Comparatives. Listen. Solar power is cleaner than fossil fuels.

14
00:01:29.148 --> 00:01:34.953
Your turn. Say it with me. Solar power is cleaner than fossil fuels.

15
00:01:39.869 --> 00:01:52.381
Renewable energy, like solar power and wind turbines, offers a sustainable alternative to fossil fuels. Clean energy resources help reduce harmful emissions and protect our planet's future.

16
00:01:52.431 --> 00:01:53.949
I like this story!

17
00:01:55.272 --> 00:02:00.482
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:00.532 --> 00:02:01.752
Wind turbine!

19
00:02:02.727 --> 00:02:08.002
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:08.052 --> 00:02:09.331
Clean energy!

21
00:02:10.411 --> 00:02:18.885
Think and answer. Why is renewable energy important for the future?

22
00:02:18.935 --> 00:02:20.085
Great answer!

23
00:02:21.373 --> 00:02:25.067
This unit's value is Environmental Responsibility.

24
00:02:25.117 --> 00:02:29.058
I can show environmental responsibility every day!

25
00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:38.493
Congratulations, everyone! You finished Secondary Level four. See you in Level five. Goodbye!

26
00:02:38.543 --> 00:02:42.343
Thank you, Teacher Vibol! See you in Level 5!

